:R-HSA-69109  a             owl:NamedIndividual , obo:GO_0008150 ;
        rdfs:comment        "The processive complex is responsible for synthesizing at least 5-10 kb of DNA in a continuous manner during leading strand synthesis. The incorporation of nucleotides by pol delta is quite accurate. However, incorporation of an incorrect nucleotide does occur occasionally. Misincorporated nucleotides are removed by the 3' to 5' exonucleolytic proofreading capability of pol delta." ;
        rdfs:label          "Leading Strand Synthesis" ;
        dc:contributor      "GOC:reactome_curators" ;
        dc:date             "2023-06-21" ;
